<title>MEXICO: U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to March 26.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to March 26.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Soybean Association updated Friday, via its local office, U.S. exports of soybeans to Mexico.</p>
<p>Volumes are in tonnes, accumulated week-on-week for the marketing year Sept 1 - Aug 31.</p>
<p>    Week Ending    Accum Total    Week Ending    Accum Total</p>
<p>    24/01/96	    922,000	29/01/97	 1,178,000</p>
<p>    07/02/96	  1,038,000	07/02/97	     N/A</p>
<p>    14/02/96	  1,100,000	14/02/97	     N/A</p>
<p>    22/02/96	  1,166,000	20/02/97	 1,394,000</p>
<p>    28/02/96	  1,185,000	28/02/97	     N/A</p>
<p>    06/03/96	  1,259,000	05/03/97	 1,584,000</p>
<p>    03/04/96	  1,489,000	26/03/97	 1,745,000</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530)). E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
